<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Wednesday, slaughter steers and heifers sold steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1125-1400 lbs 63.00-64.50. Select and choice 2-3 1100-1525 lbs 62.00-63.50.  Select 2-3 1150-1385 lbs 58.00-62.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 980-1200 lbs 62.00-63.60. Few sales Select 2-3 1000-1150 lbs 55.50-58.25.</p>
</text>
